{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>據新華社5月6日報道，中國外長王毅在北京與伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araghchi）舉行會談。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260506/1128647281659088896946108.jpeg/fAmvJtwkO79xYpW-W3lb5EYyz3akUv5MnZb1_p2W9f4\" alt=\"2026年5月6日，中國外長王毅（右）在北京與伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araghchi，左）舉行會談。（X@CGTNOfficial）\"><figcaption>2026年5月6日，中國外長王毅（右）在北京與伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araghchi，左）舉行會談。（X@CGTNOfficial）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T03:19:23.478899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}